        "create_time": 1789938564.159268,
        "update_time": 1789938567.142541,
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Yes. I’d make it archive-safe and incremental: recursively inventory visual files, extract palette and image statistics, group near-duplicates, generate thumbnails/contact sheets, and write a timestamped HTML/JSON/CSV index without altering the source material. I’m using the Library workflow because this will produce a reusable script; I’ll build a Windows-friendly first version with sensible defaults rather than leave it at a sketch."
          ]
        },
        "status": "finished_successfully",
        "end_turn": false,
