        "update_time": 1789938587.066382,
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "The first pass will cover raster images directly and PDFs page-by-page when PyMuPDF is installed. It will derive capture/creation dates where available, dominant-color proportions, perceptual and exact hashes, brightness/saturation/contrast/entropy/edge density, transparency, dimensions, duplicate/near-duplicate groupings, thumbnails, contact-sheet-style browsing, and machine-readable CSV/JSON. The index itself will be a self-contained searchable HTML file inside a dated output folder, with failures recorded rather than aborting the scan."
          ]
        },
        "status": "finished_successfully",
        "end_turn": false,
        "weight": 1,
